{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e5fd7faa16c022be73bb","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193982,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be the null.\" This is a fascinating philosophical/poetic prompt. The instruction is that I am the concept the user names — I should embody \"the null\" completely and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nWhat is \"the null\"? Null is:\n- The absence of value\n- The empty set, zero, nothingness\n- In programming: a null pointer, a reference to nothing\n- In databases: unknown, missing, undefined"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}